120|recommendation         keyboard.kitty-unsupported: The terminal did not answer the Kitty keyboard query, so keys such as
119|                       shift+enter may not be told apart. Fix: Use a terminal with the Kitty keyboard protocol, such as
 63|                       kitty, Ghostty, WezTerm, foot or iTerm2.
120|recommendation         terminal.unknown: Nothing names the terminal, so capabilities that depend on it are off. Fix: Set
 68|                       TERM_PROGRAM, or let LC_TERMINAL through SSH.
